Recommends: bluez
Description: MeshCore mesh messenger for the ClockworkPi uConsole
 Corelet is a Qt 6 client for a MeshCore node. It talks to a umeshcored
 companion daemon over TCP, or straight to a MeshCore device over Bluetooth
 LE, and shows the node's channels as a chat window laid out for the
 uConsole's 1280x480 panel.
 .
 All radio work, crypto and channel state live in the daemon or in the device
 firmware, so this package is the client and nothing else. Message history is
 kept locally in one SQLite database per node, because collecting a message
 removes it from the daemon's inbox.
